<title>TURKEY: Turkish EGS mandates Bankers Trust for synd loan.</title>
<headline>Turkish EGS mandates Bankers Trust for synd loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's private EGS Bank has mandated Bankers Trust to arrange a $25 million syndciated loan, bank officials said.</p>
<p>They said the one-year pre-export financing facility was expected to be concluded by July 25.</p>
<p>It will be the bank's first borrowing attempt in the international loan market.</p>
</text>
